41464::$$$message_0301_0000_0000$$$::"Illyasviel's swimsuit.[br]What is this restlessness I can't quite explain?"::
41465::$$$message_0301_0001_0000$$$::"Between 'criminal' and 'crime,' we need to reexamine which of these is more sin or punishment."::
41466::$$$message_0301_0002_0000$$$::"No, we don't."::
41467::$$$message_0301_0003_0000$$$::"...Now.[lr]::
41468::$$$message_0301_0003_0001$$$::I have a message from the higher-ups for all you big brothers whom Illyasviel loves more than having three meals a day."::
41469::$$$message_0301_0004_0000$$$::"'Her only new outfit [wm canskip=0][wm canskip=0][wvs][sestop time=700 nowait=1][lr]::
41470::$$$message_0301_0004_0001$$$::is the [wm canskip=0][wm canskip=0][wvs][sestop time=700 nowait=1][lr]::
41471::$$$message_0301_0004_0002$$$::swimsuit, [wm canskip=0][wm canskip=0][wvs][sestop time=700 nowait=1]::
41472::$$$message_0301_0005_0000$$$::actually. [wm canskip=0][wm canskip=0][lr]::
41473::$$$message_0301_0005_0001$$$::                                                     Sorry.'"[cacheimage storage=アーチャー神主01g(遠),凛巫女服01b(遠)][wvs][wait canskip=0 time=800][se storage=se098.wav][movefg textoff=0 opacity=0 left=-333 top=0 time=150 accel=0 storage=アーチャー神主01g(遠)][movefg textoff=0 opacity=0 left=832 top=127 time=150 accel=0 storage=凛巫女服01b(遠)][lr]::

